From ec5f688a3c87dbaff99ee633be11a7a6485a5420 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: joey <joey@Mac-Studio.local>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 00:57:41 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] relay_metrics: add mainloop cleanup, tick stall, and
 BEGIN_DIR metrics

Add nine fixed-cardinality Prometheus metrics on MetricsPort to observe
mainloop connection-list occupancies, cleanup pass work/duration,
event-loop tick stalls, and server-side BEGIN_DIR request classes, HTTP
statuses, stream lifecycle phases, circuit reuse, and application bytes:

- tor_relay_mainloop_connection_list_size{list}
- tor_relay_mainloop_connection_list_ops_total{list,op}
- tor_relay_mainloop_close_pass_total{field}
- tor_relay_mainloop_ticks_total{threshold}
- tor_relay_mainloop_tick_max_duration_usec
- tor_relay_dir_streams_total{phase}
- tor_relay_dir_streams_active{state}
- tor_relay_dir_http_requests_total{class,status}
- tor_relay_dir_bytes_total{class,dir}
---
